  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Once a lead guitarist for 'The Quackaneers,' Witherwing's band was drowned out by the 'Great Chain Halt.' Now, the only music he hears is the clatter of scavenged scrap and the distant cries for DRIP.",
    "class": "Rogue Rockstar",
    "name": "Witherwing",
    "personality": "Cynical: Beneath the hooded mudder exterior lies a duck who's seen it all crash and burn. Resourceful: Years of touring and band-aids (literal and figurative) have made him adept at making the most of limited gear. Callous: Has a hard time empathizing with other ducks, after the loss of his band.",
